  "description": "Pool operations per VendorAccount (Module C, J4): PoolGauge purchased vs assigned vs pending invites vs free, low-pool attention state, renewal date and mode chip. Purchase-or-reclaim callout when a blocked request exists: inactive candidates beside the prorated purchase note, with actions to propose reclamation or register a purchase (VendorAccountCapacity row).",
